t well beats multiplying its phrasings. Scaling should make meaningful coverage easier while preserving the ability to reject output that adds nothing for readers."]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"deep-dive","className":"article-prose deep-dive","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"A template should organise knowledge you actually have"}],[["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["Programmatic publishing works best when each page has a distinct, useful reason to exist. A structured dataset can support a directory, comparison or reference series, but changing a keyword inside the same paragraph does not create a new explanation. Define the minimum evidence and editorial fields required for one complete page before generating a batch. Include examples, limitations and relationships that are specific to the subject. If the input does not support those fields, keep the item in a research queue rather than publishing a thin placeholder."]}]]}]],["$","figure",null,{"className":"editorial-diagram diagram-flow","children":[["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mono acid","children":"THE IDEA, UNPACKED"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"A publishing gate, not a page factory"}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"diagram-items","children":[["$","li","Evidence",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Evidence"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Distinct material supporting a real reader question."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Structure",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Structure"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Required fields, sources, examples and limits."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Review",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Review"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Check usefulness before adding the page to discovery."}],false]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"diagram-caption","children":"Editorial model: a way to reason about the process, not measured platform results."}]]}],["$L1a"]]}],false,false,"$L1b","$undefined","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f"]}],"$L20"]}]
16:["$","section",null,{"className":"related-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"section-heading","children":["$","h2",null,{"children":"Other currents."}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-grid","children":[["$","$L21","096",{"a":{"id":"096","author":"jet","slug":"llm-quoting","category":"machines","term":"LLM quoting","kind":"guide","image":"llm-quoting","media":"$1:props:children:1:props:next:media","en":{"title":"Writing AGD Content That Search and AI Can Cite","dek":"Citable content clearly states a proposition, scope and provenance."},"readingMinutes":2},"lang":"en"}],["$","$L21","094",{"a":{"id":"094","author":"jet","slug":"seo-agd","category":"machines","term":"SEO AGD","kind":"guide","image":"seo-agd","media":"$1:props:children:1:props:previous:media","en":{"title":"AGD and SEO: Turn Social Ideas into Searchable Articles","dek":"SEO AGD explores social content and properties appearing in search engines and platform search."},"readingMinutes":2},"lang":"en"}],["$","$L21","001",{"a":{"id":"001","author":"organic-club-editorial","slug":"distribution-is-the-moat","category":"doctrine","term":"Account-Generated Distribution","kind":"essay","image":"distribution-is-the-moat","media":{"kind":"illustration","src":"/images/iceberg.jpg","width":1536,"height":1024,"alt":{"en":"Night iceberg with a green submerged mass, a metaphor for unseen distribution."},"credit":"THE ORGANIC CLUB Studio","provenance":"Original AI-generated editorial illustration created for this publication on September 8, 2026. Not a documentary photograph.","source":"https://theorganiclub.com/images/iceberg.jpg","license":"Original artwork","licenseUrl":"https://theorganiclub.com/en/about/#images"},"en":{"title":"What Is AGD Marketing? Account-Generated Distribution Explained","dek":"Everyone can produce. Almost nobody knows how to distribute. Welcome to the other side of the iceberg."},"readingMinutes":5},"lang":"en"}]]}]]}]
1a:["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["Validate both structure and substance. Check unique identifiers, working references, complete media provenance and meaningful differences between pages. Review a sample for repetition and unsupported claims, then investigate any systematic pattern before scaling further. Keep a way to update or retire pages when the underlying information changes. The useful efficiency comes from automating assembly around strong material. It does not come from making an under-researched page cheap enough to publish ten thousand times. A smaller collection that answers real questions is a better starting asset for future expansion."]}]]}]]}]
1b:["$","blockquote",null,{"children":["“","Programmatic content needs a reason for every page.","”"]}]
